# Force LF on checkout on every platform (crlfcheckout, C.1.3.2). Parity with the
# onedrive adapter: the bundle and shell wrapper must stay byte-identical to the
# LF-committed blobs so the canonical SHA holds regardless of host OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
dist/aifs-exec.bundle.js text eol=lf
dist/aifs-exec.sh text eol=lf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
